  "body": "I would love to try WebUSB API on existing devices. As per WebAPI spec, it is allowed by some kind of \r\nPublic Device Registry [doc](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#public-device-registry). As per [issue](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=598765) Registry still is not ready and seems won't be ready soon.\r\n\r\nIs there any way to make WebUSB work with existing device without WebUSB support? ",
